            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
                <ab xml:id="MP0038_trans-p1">
                    <lb n="1-4" xml:id="trans-p1-l1-4"/>Cities (fortified places) for which it is necessary to put into the dépôt (revenue office): A 390,000 drahm, B Kust ī zafarānag 223,000 <supplied resp="#DW">drahm</supplied>, C slṭwydy 182,000 drahm, D Giyāh 230,000 drahm, E Wigrādag 200,000 drahm,
